# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Edge Function secrets — TEMPLATE
#
#   copy → supabase/functions/.env   (gitignored) and fill in the real values.
#
# This file is the ONLY place server-side secrets belong. It is:
#   · auto-loaded for LOCAL function dev by `supabase start` / `functions serve`
#   · pushed to HOSTED functions with `supabase secrets set --env-file …`
#
# ── What you do NOT put here ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase INJECTS these into every Edge Function automatically — setting them
# yourself is unnecessary, and any name starting with SUPABASE_ is reserved:
#
#   SUPABASE_URL                 the API gateway
#   SUPABASE_DB_URL              direct Postgres connection
#   SUPABASE_JWKS                the JWK set for verifying user JWTs
#   SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEYS    JSON dict — safe in a browser (RLS applies)
#   SUPABASE_SECRET_KEYS         JSON dict — BYPASSES RLS. Server only.
#   (legacy) SUPABASE_ANON_KEY · SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# The service-role / secret key is therefore NEVER something you set here.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Path C cartoonization (ADR-002) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# fal.ai key. This is the ONLY metered spend in the MVP — ≈US$0.09/picture.
# Read in the function as: Deno.env.get('FAL_KEY')
FAL_KEY=

# ── Optional, for the cron / Edge Functions that need a back-channel ───────
# Only if a function must call the DB as a privileged actor AND you cannot use
# the injected SUPABASE_SECRET_KEYS. Leave blank unless you know you need it.
# APP_SECRET_KEY=